{"v":4,"catch":"在敵人之前拔出你的槍！！","desc":"《EMPIRE CITY: 1931》是《SEIBU KAIHATSU》於1986年發行的一款槍戰遊戲。\n設定在1931年的美國。從窗戶，從屋頂，在躲藏的時候，各種各樣的敵人都在瞄准我們！\n在你的對手面前拔出槍，擊敗一個接一個出現的敵人！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-03-24","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/392c666e676131fcae9f69a2dabe6e53010b988371c84f9747ceed33338b731d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b582ea491a32727aea7c4b07efdf4f961b9cc94d5c754b54d2bc2bc64aae872f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5990be2b7cc80711a0d73d0871d240137ae5c61ce79320900dc6458e223b4864.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ec0898090e5df8d56c076abe149e27002cc5feddfde41bedc2adc3eea4bcdba1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4981826a484bb8868aa08d247c1b2ff70831b7e5a0a7bde669335865979468b1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c5d4ab01120d717870d6436e89ef261a5e53d516686fbef771099de67435a288.jpg"],"titleId":"0100403017202000","dlc":[]}